---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Give Me Feedback | Alexander Müller"
  description="Share your honest feedback, suggestions, criticism, or compliments - anonymously or not."
>
  <section class="py-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Give Me Feedback</h1>
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-8 text-lg">
        It seems to me that one of the big problems in our society is that everyone's afraid to tell you you're wrong, or they think they have to dance around it. I value honest feedback in my attempt to continuously do better! If you have suggestions, criticism, or compliments you'd like to share based on any interaction we've ever had (or even based on something you've seen from me online), I'd love to hear from you.   
      </p>
      
      <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Anonymous Feedback</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">
          Want to share something without revealing your identity? Use the anonymous form below. Your feedback helps me grow and improve.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="https://forms.gle/3vGYE7xHff92r9JR7" 
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white rounded-md transition-colors font-medium"
        >
          Send Anonymous Feedback
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-8 p-6 border dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Direct Feedback</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          If you'd prefer to discuss something directly, feel free to reach out via email or through my <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:alexanderklavermuller@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">alexanderklavermuller at gmail dot com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

